WEBVTT

00:00:05.603 --> 00:00:11.399
Choose Upload in the side menu.

00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:17.649
Click Choose videos.

00:00:21.464 --> 00:00:27.464
Choose a file from your computer,
named "flaky-lesson.mp4".

00:00:28.318 --> 00:00:33.212
Wait until you see Retry.

00:00:33.462 --> 00:00:37.924
Click Retry flaky-lesson.mp4.

00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:44.174
Wait until you see Uploaded just now.
